getCctpDomain.t.sol
├── when the provided EVM chain ID is the Mainnet chain ID (1)
│  └── it should return the Mainnet CCTP domain (0)
└── when the provided EVM chain ID is not the Mainnet chain ID
   ├── given no CCTP domain is registered for the provided EVM chain ID
   │  └── it should revert with CctpDomainNotRegistered
   └── given a CCTP domain is registered for the provided EVM chain ID
      └── it should return the registered CCTP domain
